WEBVTT

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:02.920
Hi!

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:10.830
...that I find myself a wonderful boyfriend... and then...

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:16.010
...and then...

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:29.920
I'm gonna strut my stuff!

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:48.960
As I tried to kiss you, as if to avoid me...

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:56.770
...with your T-Shirt on,
you dove into the shining sea...

00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:03.140
The white flower petals on your soaking skirt...

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:09.710
Spread open upon the surface of the blue water.

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:18.730
Tell me why, when you winked...

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:26.670
...to tell me that you'd be mine...

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:31.340
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me -
You're unpredictable...

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:34.640
'Tell me you love me,
Tell me that you need me...

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:38.550
Tell Me, Tell Me,
...my Angel of the Summer...

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:41.150
'Tell me, lover, Tell me that you need me...

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:45.690
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me -
I know that you're in love...

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:49.090
'Tell me you love me,
Tell me that you need me...

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:55.600
Tell Me, Tell Me - but you're a mystery.

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:12.430
Dangerous Decision!
Manami-chan's Big Adventure.

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:44.310
Hi!

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:46.600
Komatsu, Hatta... How are you doing?

00:02:48.670 --> 00:02:50.790
Uh-huh! Doing fine! Yes indeedy!

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:54.330
H... Hey! Who was that?! Is she from our school?!

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:56.850
Here! Go find out!

00:02:56.850 --> 00:02:58.780
R... Right! Okay! Okay!
Here! Go find out!

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:02.120
Lemmesee here...

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:08.110
Huh?! What the heck is this?! Huh?! Oh?!

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:11.550
Permit me to contact her before you do!

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:15.090
Hey! Hatta! You cheater! Wait, will ya!

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:17.550
Hey, babe! Where did you go, babe?!

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:19.280
Babe!

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:19.370
Where did you go?! Babe!

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:21.800
Hey!
Where did you go?! Babe!

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:21.940
Where did you go?! Babe!

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:23.740
Where did you go?!
Where did you go?! Babe!

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:23.830
Where did you go?! Babe!

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:26.650
Looks like those two
couldn't figure out who I am!

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:31.010
And why not?!
It's Manami's Super Makeover!

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:39.860
I'm at an age when I need to play hard,
just like everybody else!

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:42.700
I gotta play HARD!

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:45.800
Hot lovin' with cool boys...

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:48.590
...and then...

00:03:57.770 --> 00:04:00.440
I'm gonna strut my stuff!

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:16.010
G... God, it's spicy!
What's up with the stew?!

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:19.670
Gosh, Oniichan, you're such an old fogey!

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:23.770
Don't you know that Super-Spicy Gourmet
is the latest thing?!

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:26.590
Right, Papa? Isn't it good?

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:27.950
Huh? Y... Yeah.

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:36.060
But... Well, five bottles of Tabasco might be a bit too... ...little?

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:39.600
First of all... normally people cut up the ingredients!

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:41.710
See this?! I'll be honest, how could you eat this?

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:44.250
Kyosuke!

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:51.070
'Cuz! 'Cuz! Manami's
disappeared somewhere...

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:54.170
...so I had to do the cooking for her at the last minute.

00:04:54.170 --> 00:05:01.430
Sure... compared to Manami,
my cooking might not taste as good...

00:05:10.650 --> 00:05:14.610
It's GOOD! I've never ever had such a good stew!

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:44.540
T... To begin with... a little test.

00:05:58.930 --> 00:06:01.900
Not good! This won't do!

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:10.100
E... E... Excuse me, but...

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:12.880
Can I help you?

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:15.470
...d... d... does...
Can I help you?

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:21.570
...does a "Kasuga Jingoro" live around here?

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:23.370
I'm such a moron!

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:25.600
"Kasuga Jingoro?"

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:29.370
There's nobody with that kinda name
living around here.

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:32.540
There's a police box straight ahead, so why don't you ask there.

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:34.560
'Bye.

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:50.640
I'll never find a boyfriend if I do it this way!

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:57.170
All right!

00:06:57.170 --> 00:07:00.310
Did you check out that new show last night?!
Talk about a BOMB!

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:00.560
Say, you two...

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:02.490
I won't be watching THAT next week!
Say, you two...

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:10.060
Would you buy me a drink?

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:12.230
Who, me, Miss?!

00:07:12.230 --> 00:07:14.290
H... Hey!
Who, me, Miss?!

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:17.290
That's right. I'm kinda bored.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:20.210
Oh, gosh... You got me!

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:21.040
Hey!
Oh, gosh... You got me!

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:21.130
Oh, gosh... You got me!

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:22.780
Excuse me, but we have to go!

00:07:22.780 --> 00:07:23.680
Oh!
Excuse me, but we have to go!

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:24.180
Good-bye!
Oh!

00:07:24.180 --> 00:07:24.310
Good-bye!

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:25.940
Hey!
Good-bye!

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.700
Whew!

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:33.720
Still, there was nothing to it!

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:45.430
Say, wanna buy me a drink?

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:55.100
Who's the twerp?

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:59.140
She's not from around here.
Thinks she's special or somethin', maybe?

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:02.950
Let's do it.

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:16.650
You got some nerve!

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:19.460
We don't like it when our turf's messed with.

00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:24.640
"Messed with?" What're you talking about?!

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:32.750
Don't play dumb!

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:40.350
Yoo-hoo, Officer! Over here!
Over here, sir!

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:42.430
Wh... What the?! Uh-oh!

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:42.860
Uh-oh!
Wh... What the?! Uh-oh!

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:43.760
Hey!
Uh-oh!

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:51.230
Goddammit! She made fools out of us!

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:54.940
"3 frogs and 3 frogs"
"3 Frogs:" a standard tongue-twister. Kyosuke is mangling it badly.

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:57.600
"All together... 6 frogs"
"3 Frogs:" a standard tongue-twister. Kyosuke is mangling it badly.

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:01.830
"The guest from next-door is a guest who likes to eat persimmons a lot!"

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:06.220
Having force-fed myself the super-spicy gourmet delight, my voice...

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:09.000
...felt like it was that of a frog,
after it's been squashed by a car.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:13.420
Somebody! Help me!

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:22.630
T... This doesn't look good!

00:09:42.590 --> 00:09:45.550
Oh! My contacts!

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:51.380
How dare you diss the "Red Scorpions!"

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:54.430
Hey... Unhand her!

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:01.230
Girls, how can you do this in broad daylight.
Kinda uncool, isn't it?

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:08.230
Beat it, before you get beaten.

00:10:17.690 --> 00:10:19.180
Eat this!

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:25.610
Geez! What a bozo!

00:10:25.610 --> 00:10:26.390
Finish him!

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:26.460
Right!

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:27.430
Right!
Right!

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:36.930
STOP!

00:10:46.650 --> 00:10:49.210
C'mon! H...H...Hurry!

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:53.270
What the hell happened?!

00:10:53.270 --> 00:10:54.620
They're getting away!

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:56.150
Don't let 'em!
They're getting away!

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:58.760
Move it, you...

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:07.600
Madoka, don't you agree
that this was a steal?

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:12.570
I wonder if this kinda thing would make Darling say, "That's cute!"

00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:15.380
Madoka?

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:17.350
Oh?
Madoka?

00:11:19.480 --> 00:11:20.820
Kasuga!

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:22.310
What?! Really?!
Kasuga!

00:11:22.310 --> 00:11:22.400
Kasuga!

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:24.420
Gee. That's not him.

00:11:38.500 --> 00:11:41.850
Th... That's Darling!

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:44.840
Madoka!

00:11:50.110 --> 00:11:50.780
Where did they go?!

00:11:50.780 --> 00:11:52.750
Where did they go?!
Where did they go?!

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:09.890
Whew! That was a close call!

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:12.590
Yes! Thank you so much for your help!

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:16.410
At that moment, I felt as if...

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:22.040
...I'd seen her... somewhere before... but...

00:12:35.530 --> 00:12:38.900
Oh! So cute!

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:46.980
How expensive!

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:50.910
I'd be better off buying the materials and making one myself.

00:12:55.150 --> 00:12:57.120
Here you go!

00:13:09.130 --> 00:13:12.120
Oh! This is so delicious!

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:15.660
Uh-huh! I bet the secret is in
the amount of egg and butter!

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:17.970
You like cooking?

00:13:17.970 --> 00:13:21.140
Yes. Very much!
You like cooking?

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:27.080
Um...

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:28.250
Huh?
Um...

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:28.320
Um... You must be really strong.
Huh?

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:30.320
Um... You must be really strong.

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:31.420
What are you talking about?
Um... You must be really strong.

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:33.560
That was really a risky situation.
What are you talking about?

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:33.690
That was really a risky situation.

00:13:33.690 --> 00:13:35.250
Oh! That!
That was really a risky situation.

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:35.300
That was really a risky situation.

00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:38.820
Well, that was, er... nothing!
Nothing, really!

00:13:38.820 --> 00:13:41.080
I bet you study Karate or Judo, right?

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:43.880
Er... Right! Right! Judo!

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:46.900
Yeah, I study Judo all right!

00:13:58.950 --> 00:13:59.920
By the way, did you...

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:01.010
Huh?
By the way, did you...

00:14:01.010 --> 00:14:01.120
By the way, did you...

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:04.950
...I'm just wondering but... did you
run away from home or something?

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:08.930
Huh?! Run away from home?!

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:10.620
Oh, no!

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:16.060
Though...

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:18.900
...maybe I should...

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:20.710
What?!
...maybe I should...

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:20.770
Just kidding!
What?!

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:22.370
Just kidding!

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:25.340
G...Gee...
Just kidding!

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:30.640
I've somehow started feeling... that every day is so dull.

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:35.700
Each day, before I go to school, I do the laundry, cleaning...

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:37.950
...and make breakfast for everyone in the house.

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:41.420
It's the same thing, day after day.

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:47.970
Oh, and also, my Oniichan is always dirty when he gets into the bath...

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:52.520
...so the bathtub gets scummy.
Cleaning the tub afterwards is a major chore!

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:56.150
Your brother must be
lacking in tenderness, eh?

00:14:56.150 --> 00:14:58.220
Oh, no. I didn't mean it in a bad way.

00:14:58.220 --> 00:15:00.660
It's just that he's a little
inconsiderate sometimes, see.

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:02.710
I see.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:07.160
I wish I could escape from...
what feels like a humdrum existence...

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:09.050
...shed my skin...

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:13.220
...and fly like a butterfly!

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:28.300
All right! Let's fly high, together!

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:39.780
Well, it's not as cool as actually flying, but...

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:49.150
This morning, see...
I made a certain decision.

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:51.280
What was it?

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:53.940
That I would find myself a wonderful boyfriend...

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:56.700
...and then...

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:58.890
...and then...?
...and then...

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:02.040
...and then...

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:12.610
I'm so glad that I met you.

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:25.440
I thought that her voice sounded rather familiar...

00:16:25.440 --> 00:16:27.960
...but who could imagine such a situation?!

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:29.430
Where is she?!

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:31.900
Where did she go?
Where is she?!

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:37.920
Um... Not feeling well?

00:16:37.920 --> 00:16:40.790
Um... What happened?!

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:44.090
E...Er... I, er...

00:16:44.090 --> 00:16:46.770
I...I'll go get us some drinks... s...so, wait here, okay?

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:52.120
Uh-huh.

00:17:02.930 --> 00:17:05.750
"I'm so glad that I met you..."

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:08.270
What's your explanation?!

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:10.000
Ayukawa!

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:13.190
Darling, you're cruel!

00:17:13.190 --> 00:17:14.560
Hikaru!

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:17.660
You got it all wrong.
This isn't what you think.

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:20.680
Take a close look at her!

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:28.060
Manami?!

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:30.030
What?!
Manami?!

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:33.510
Nobody knew...

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:38.140
...that Manami was keeping
so much to herself all this time...

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:41.570
There's no way I can leave things as they are!

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:04.790
Is something wrong?

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:06.760
Oh, no!
Is something wrong?

00:19:27.010 --> 00:19:28.980
Listen...

00:19:40.790 --> 00:19:43.950
We'd better call it a day soon...

00:19:46.860 --> 00:19:49.990
I think it's time for you to go home.

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:54.420
But... If you don't get home on time, they'll be concerned about you...

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:57.390
...your family, that is...

00:19:57.390 --> 00:20:02.600
You were able to fly more than enough... I think.

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:14.190
Don't get too carried away!

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:17.690
Can I... see you again?

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:35.110
Good-bye...

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:39.400
Yo!

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:41.430
We won't let you get away this time.

00:20:41.430 --> 00:20:43.920
This time, you'll play with us.

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:50.030
You fooled us real good before.

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:52.440
We're SO happy to have found you!

00:20:52.440 --> 00:20:56.150
We won't let you go this time around!

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:58.110
Please stop!

00:20:58.110 --> 00:20:59.900
Shut up!

00:21:00.270 --> 00:21:02.330
Who's that?!

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:06.380
A... Ayukawa...

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:08.660
What?!" "Ms...."

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:10.030
Wh... What now?!

00:21:10.030 --> 00:21:13.080
Don't chicken out! There's three of us!

00:21:14.180 --> 00:21:16.150
We can beat her!

00:21:59.060 --> 00:22:01.310
M... Madoka...

00:22:01.310 --> 00:22:04.330
Is that you, Madoka?

00:22:09.840 --> 00:22:12.810
You look just right... with your glasses on.

00:22:32.260 --> 00:22:34.080
I'm home!

00:22:34.080 --> 00:22:34.980
Listen! Listen!

00:22:34.980 --> 00:22:37.690
You won't believe your eyes;
Oniichan's got a real surprise for you!

00:22:45.910 --> 00:22:50.050
All of this! Oniichan did it all by himself, y'know!

00:22:50.050 --> 00:22:52.270
Is this amazing or what?

00:23:04.960 --> 00:23:06.930
Oniichan, thanks!

00:23:08.960 --> 00:23:12.590
Who knew you were so whimsical?

00:23:36.130 --> 00:23:40.430
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:44.680
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:23:44.680 --> 00:23:49.020
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:23:49.020 --> 00:23:53.250
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:23:53.250 --> 00:24:01.130
On that last night we went out for a drive,
I left my go-out voice behind.

00:24:01.130 --> 00:24:10.630
As we watched the horizon, I said good-bye.

00:24:10.630 --> 00:24:18.440
Like seasons, hit songs come and go...
As you get used to one, you're tired of it...

00:24:18.440 --> 00:24:27.120
That's what's written on your profile.

00:24:27.120 --> 00:24:36.830
You were waiting for the lucky star in your room...

00:24:36.830 --> 00:24:45.210
...I was too late to notice it in that one phone call that day.

00:24:45.210 --> 00:24:49.540
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:24:49.540 --> 00:24:53.880
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:24:53.880 --> 00:24:58.180
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:24:58.180 --> 00:25:02.520
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:25:02.520 --> 00:25:07.350
Erase the memory of you from me...
"Stop, Stop, Stop."

00:25:12.890 --> 00:25:15.100
Jingoro's been acting weird lately...

00:25:15.100 --> 00:25:17.300
Running wild one moment, quiet as a clam the next.

00:25:17.300 --> 00:25:19.170
Are you sick or something?

00:25:19.170 --> 00:25:22.510
I know! You want a lover, don't you?

00:25:22.510 --> 00:25:26.710
As your owner, perhaps I ought to
find you a hot girlfriend!

00:25:26.710 --> 00:25:30.800
Next time: "Don't Cry Jingoro! The Heat of Young Love."
